    "detailed_description": "Get ready for a far-out adventure that flips the dating sim genre upside down and powerbombs it through a ringside table! It's time to bodyslam a diverse cast of muscle cuties and wrestling weirdos!<br><br>The world's cuddliest choice-based life / wrestling / dating simulator is back! Enter the surreal world of 'Wrestling With Emotions' with a game that's bursting with heart, humor and muscle-bound cuties! Create yr dream wrestle-babe and tell a unique story of bent rules, broken hearts and bulging biceps!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1431250/extras/ac49205390ee4cdab69eff7fdff53a34.poster.avif?t=1709796149\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1431250/extras/ac49205390ee4cdab69eff7fdff53a34.webm?t=1709796149\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1431250/extras/ac49205390ee4cdab69eff7fdff53a34.mp4?t=1709796149\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1431250/extras/89c3fca9b4791e35ee7719bbe9a8c06b.poster.avif?t=1709796149\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1431250/extras/89c3fca9b4791e35ee7719bbe9a8c06b.webp?t=1709796149\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div><br><br>The year is 1994. Wrestling is radder than ever. You just landed your dream gig, performing alongside your heroes in \u201cWrestling With Emotions\u201d! The big boss, Manny McMan, is just looking for another low-level jobber and your coach Major Malfunction doesn't see much potential in you. Guess you'll just have to prove them wrong! Or you could be a total slacker? It's your call!<br><br>Befriend, seduce, enrage and bodyslam a diverse cast of adorable muscle cuties to build the friendships and rivalries that will take you from new kid to the next Wrestling With Emotions superstar!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1431250/extras/fb682f58eb26112ffdd88d3c576840e1.poster.avif?t=1709796149\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1431250/extras/fb682f58eb26112ffdd88d3c576840e1.webm?t=1709796149\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1431250/extras/967c05c05edf3f9cd088561041362061.poster.avif?t=1709796149\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1431250/extras/967c05c05edf3f9cd088561041362061.webp?t=1709796149\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div><br>Do you want to be a muscle-bound himbo? Do you dream of being the most elegant warrior in the ring? Do you want to put the attitude back into wrestling? Maybe you just want to blow audiences away with your theatrics? In 'Wrestling With Emotions' you can do it all! There are no wrong choices in this story that celebrates individuality, and rewards every player with their own absurd adventure!<br><br>Meaningful choices and role-playing take center stage as you build your dream wrestler! Attract the perfect partner as you pump up your MEAT (Muscle, Elegance, Attitude &amp; Theatrics)! Shape a unique personality by growing your BONES (Bodacious, Open, Nervous Easy Going &amp; Steadfast)! Develop your own wrestling style with your GUTS (Grabby, Uppies, Throws and Strikes). Combine MEAT, BONES &amp; GUTS to create brand-new power moves and finishers!<br><br>On your path to becoming a legend, who will stand in your way and who will fight by your side? Only you can find out!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1431250/extras/31dc8bf8ed708ecf893540271eebedae.poster.avif?t=1709796149\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1431250/extras/31dc8bf8ed708ecf893540271eebedae.webm?t=1709796149\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1431250/extras/2c5b01664ce973d0dcf48b9e6446fb82.poster.avif?t=1709796149\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1431250/extras/2c5b01664ce973d0dcf48b9e6446fb82.webp?t=1709796149\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div><br>* Craft a one-of-a-kind wrestler with the 'Look Out Lovers' character creator!<br>* Pump up your M.E.A.T (Muscle, Elegance, Attitude &amp; Theatrics) in 8 training minigames!<br>* Develop close partnerships or forge bitter rivalries with a diverse stable of 7 date-able dreamboats!<br>* Invent unique signature moves to crush your crush!<br>* Play by your own rules! Choices shape your character and their path through the promotion!<br>* Enjoy hand-drawn graphics and surreal songs in classic Team Lazerbeam style!<br>* 12+ hours of playtime in each adventure, unlocking 1 of 16 explosive endings!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1431250/extras/a02125476bf848c1dd65b1cacc572cda.poster.avif?t=1709796149\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1431250/extras/a02125476bf848c1dd65b1cacc572cda.webm?t=1709796149\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1431250/extras/195225a6d5fee34f7f0f77ed5ad803df.poster.avif?t=1709796149\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1431250/extras/195225a6d5fee34f7f0f77ed5ad803df.webm?t=1709796149\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1431250/extras/195225a6d5fee34f7f0f77ed5ad803df.mp4?t=1709796149\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
